acceptance_criteria: TruffleHog OSS is SHA-pinned and scans full Git history; provider-verified live credentials and source scan errors hard-fail; deterministic current-tree Trivy plus repository pattern scans hard-fail credential shapes without depending on provider reachability; workflow policy and exact reviewed exclusion allowlist are contract-tested; free GitHub secret-scanning toggles are enabled or documented when UI-gated.
