confidence: high
release: v2026.7.26
resolution: Full-history TruffleHog rejects verified live credentials and scan failures without treating provider timeouts over PM hashes as secrets; deterministic current-tree scanners remain mandatory.
expected_result: TruffleHog verified+unknown scanning rejects credential-shaped fixtures and the PR history has been scrubbed.
actual_result: "TruffleHog 3.96.0 scanned 88,655 full-history chunks and 143,087,116 bytes with zero verified findings; focused workflow contracts, tracked secret scan, full exact coverage, lint, static quality, and SDK/package gates passed."
